      "id": "claim_eba4f8c17b0f417695a17c8eb350e8d2",
      "statement": "Brijio is a user-controlled bridge between remote AI agents and the browser session the user already controls; the extension connects only after explicit user action and agents must ask for browser state or perform actions through the MCP server. It is intentionally reactive — no continuous streaming or ambient browser surveillance — and every read or action is an explicit request returning a structured result.",
